WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.000
<b>Notes</b>

00:01.000 --> 00:03.000
<b>Your</b>

00:04.750 --> 00:06.580
I'm so stuck!

00:06.580 --> 00:09.250
That's unusual that you're stuck on lyrics.

00:09.710 --> 00:14.380
I know. You seem like you have an infinite
number of things you want to tell society.

00:14.830 --> 00:16.960
I thought I did, too.

00:16.960 --> 00:19.500
Sorry, can you wait just a bit longer?

00:19.710 --> 00:21.880
Whatever you say is fine by me, Nono-tan!

00:22.420 --> 00:25.710
Then do you want to consider that DM we got?

00:26.880 --> 00:28.040
DM?

00:28.420 --> 00:31.210
Wait, am I the only one who read it?

00:32.750 --> 00:33.540
Yeah.

00:33.920 --> 00:38.630
Are you kidding me? You're just leaving me
to check the messages, aren't you?

00:38.630 --> 00:41.000
I mean, as long as you're on top of it...

00:41.000 --> 00:42.710
Yeah, we're all set.

00:43.130 --> 00:43.750
Take a look.

00:43.750 --> 00:44.670
<b>We're JELEE
We want to make a jellyfish aquarium in Shibuya</b>

00:44.630 --> 00:45.920
Let's see...

00:44.670 --> 00:45.630
<b>Miiko - Everyone's Idol</b>

00:46.210 --> 00:51.710
"I'm messaging you hoping to
commission a song from JELEE"?!

00:51.710 --> 00:53.330
Someone wants to commission a song?!

00:53.330 --> 00:55.040
I had no idea.

00:55.330 --> 00:59.080
"I came to Tokyo with dreams of becoming a top idol,

00:59.080 --> 01:02.000
but it hasn't been easy and
I'm currently an underground idol."

01:02.250 --> 01:05.670
"So I want JELEE, the most likely candidate to become

01:05.670 --> 01:08.790
a future national singing sensation,
to help with my image..."

01:09.080 --> 01:11.210
A future national singing sensation?!

01:11.210 --> 01:12.920
"Most likely candidate," huh?

01:12.920 --> 01:14.880
They have a pretty good eye for talent!

01:14.540 --> 01:17.540
<b>Miiko - Everyone's Idol
I'm an underground idol. Come meet me at Shibuya Tornado.
All my costumes are handmade. My weight is three apples' worth. Forever 17!</b>

01:14.540 --> 01:17.540
<b>#MikomikoMiiko Fandom emoji:</b>

01:14.550 --> 01:17.540
<b> I’m fickle about replying, but getting to meet you? That's fate!</b>

01:15.040 --> 01:16.670
So who is this person?

01:18.000 --> 01:21.630
Huh? Where have I seen this Miiko before?

01:20.540 --> 01:21.750
<b>A masked singer took over my Shibuya live street gig?!
Outrageous way to end. I'm crying.</b>

01:24.290 --> 01:25.000
Oh.

01:27.290 --> 01:32.210
Mahou wa itsukara tsukaeru yoni narunoka

01:32.330 --> 01:37.080
Tokubetsu na nanika ni zutto akogareteta

01:37.380 --> 01:42.250
1 2 3 de maenarae B C D iiko ni suru no wa

01:42.380 --> 01:47.880
Watashi janai tte watashi ga ichiban shitteirunda

01:48.750 --> 01:54.460
Konomama de ii nante dare mo omocchanai yo

01:54.460 --> 01:57.250
Aseru ryouashi ga omoi no

01:58.250 --> 02:01.920
Konna ni chikaku ni iru kimi ni sae

02:02.040 --> 02:06.630
Modokashii hodo todokanai noni kono me ga utsushita

02:06.880 --> 02:12.500
Irotoridori yoridori midori no mei

02:12.500 --> 02:17.500
Nando datte mou iyannatatte kimi to kyoumei

02:17.710 --> 02:22.460
Loop shisou na shikou o yabutte

02:22.460 --> 02:27.130
Yuutsu na hibi ni mayday watashi wa chuu o matte

02:27.130 --> 02:31.790
Kumorizora no fuchi ni kaburitsuki

02:31.960 --> 02:39.750
Nomikomu nigai suppai shoppai igai ni amai no kamoshirenai na

02:42.080 --> 02:48.830
Hikari no sashikomu hou e ikunda

02:57.500 --> 02:59.580
It's been a while!

02:57.580 --> 03:01.960
<b>Episode 6:    31 (Thirty-One)</b>

02:59.750 --> 03:01.330
Unrivaled in the galaxy!

03:01.540 --> 03:04.960
An idol just waiting to hatch. I'm Miiko!

03:05.420 --> 03:07.040
Pleased to make your acquaintance!

03:08.710 --> 03:09.790
Uh...

03:10.920 --> 03:13.670
She's unrivaled in the galaxy but she's waiting to hatch?

03:13.670 --> 03:16.040
She probably never thought that one through.

03:16.460 --> 03:20.710
Okay, let's jump right into it. Can you tell us
the details of what you want to commission?

03:21.750 --> 03:23.750
Okay everyone! Hear me out!

03:23.750 --> 03:24.790
O-okay?

03:25.250 --> 03:29.040
I've been performing as a pop idol
since I was eighteen,

03:29.330 --> 03:35.210
but I haven't had much success and I think
I might have to give up on my dream at this rate...

03:36.420 --> 03:37.040
Glance.

03:37.420 --> 03:38.630
Uh-huh...

03:38.630 --> 03:43.290
Umm... How long have you been an idol for?

03:43.960 --> 03:46.040
F-fourteen years.

03:46.040 --> 03:46.790
Huh?!

03:47.210 --> 03:48.460
What's the matter?

03:48.460 --> 03:51.000
Well, she said she started when she was eighteen.

03:51.830 --> 03:53.170
You're thirty-two years old?!

03:53.170 --> 03:57.170
I am not! I just mean this is my fourteenth year,

03:57.380 --> 03:58.880
so I'm thirty-one!

03:58.880 --> 03:59.580
Like that's any different?

03:59.580 --> 04:01.000
Hey! It's completely different!

04:01.210 --> 04:04.920
Does it take that long for eggs to hatch?

04:04.920 --> 04:05.670
Urg...

04:07.290 --> 04:09.670
It's true, I'm hanging by a thread.

04:09.670 --> 04:13.830
My production company just told me that if
I don't go viral with my next song, I'm fired.

04:14.080 --> 04:16.080
What?! That's so rough.

04:16.080 --> 04:16.790
Isn't it?!

04:16.790 --> 04:19.670
<b>From Insurgent Productions</b>

04:16.790 --> 04:19.670
<b>Miiko age 17</b>

04:16.790 --> 04:19.670
<b>Production live gig
@Shibuya Tornado</b>

04:17.210 --> 04:22.790
I need to announce the song at my production's live gig
two weeks from now, but no one will write me a song!

04:25.880 --> 04:28.330
This is a more desperate request than I thought.

04:28.330 --> 04:32.130
It's a heavy responsibility.
Maybe it's best we turn her down.

04:32.130 --> 04:38.290
So you know how JELEE got its start
by taking over my gig out of nowhere?

04:38.500 --> 04:39.040
Uh?

04:39.420 --> 04:42.630
I'm so glad you've been getting popular lately.

04:42.630 --> 04:47.000
At least you ripping my poster was
worth something, you know?

04:45.710 --> 04:48.960
<b>October 27 (Fri), 2023  16:10
B1 size poster print: 6,000 yen
Special photo editing 2,500 yen</b>

04:47.000 --> 04:48.460
B-but that was...

04:48.460 --> 04:54.210
So I thought I might turn to you for help,
considering JELEE used me as a stepping stone!

04:56.630 --> 04:57.830
That's basically a threat.

04:59.580 --> 05:02.670
Okay, we're starting day one of consultations.

05:03.580 --> 05:06.920
The video's just to keep a record of our exchange, right?

05:07.170 --> 05:08.250
That's right.

05:08.630 --> 05:12.750
Because we need to create lyrics and a music video
that goes with your image, Ms. Miiko.

05:12.920 --> 05:14.420
I guess that's okay, then.

05:14.630 --> 05:16.380
Where are you heading to now?

05:16.710 --> 05:18.040
Well, it's time...

05:18.920 --> 05:20.630
to-go-to-work!

05:21.250 --> 05:22.920
Welcome, come on in!

05:23.330 --> 05:24.250
Got it!

05:24.250 --> 05:25.500
Work...
She works part-time at a yakitori joint?

05:25.630 --> 05:26.630
Chicken with leek's up!

05:26.630 --> 05:27.630
Yup, coming!

05:27.630 --> 05:29.630
Excuse me, can we order?

05:28.000 --> 05:29.380
This is really, like...

05:29.830 --> 05:31.500
Yup, sure thing!

05:30.170 --> 05:31.500
...real life, huh?

05:32.670 --> 05:34.880
Good work today! Here's your meal.

05:34.880 --> 05:35.880
Thanks!

05:36.540 --> 05:38.330
Oh, hold on everyone.

05:38.540 --> 05:40.210
I gotta make a post.

05:40.540 --> 05:43.130
It's my lifeline for getting fans, after all.

05:44.500 --> 05:46.080
Good, that'll do.

05:46.290 --> 05:47.790
What about the other ones?

05:48.040 --> 05:49.750
Oh, don't worry about those.

05:49.960 --> 05:50.420
See?

05:50.420 --> 05:53.920
<b>Miiko - Everyone's Idol
On a diet, so today's dinner is salad only!
Come find me thinner than ever at my live gig!</b>

05:51.040 --> 05:55.130
"On a diet, so today's dinner is salad only"?

05:55.540 --> 05:56.580
But that's a lie!

05:58.250 --> 06:00.920
I gotta up my image for the gig!

06:00.920 --> 06:02.750
That's the job of an idol, too!

06:03.460 --> 06:04.330
It is?

06:04.960 --> 06:09.500
Based on what I know about idols... not really?

06:10.880 --> 06:12.210
Lemme stop by here.

06:14.040 --> 06:17.330
Post-meal workout. Gonna get a six-pack this year!

06:17.670 --> 06:20.420
<b>Shibuya Station</b>

06:18.580 --> 06:22.920
It's a little warm today so I might walk for a station!

06:23.880 --> 06:26.170
She's definitely not the kind of idol I know.

06:27.290 --> 06:28.920
Thanks for having us!

06:29.380 --> 06:31.130
Welcome home, Mom!

06:31.670 --> 06:33.130
Whoa, we have guests?!

06:34.130 --> 06:36.460
You gotta tell me when you're bringing people!

06:36.790 --> 06:38.290
Whaat?!

06:38.460 --> 06:39.630
You have a kid?!

06:39.630 --> 06:40.670
She's adorable!

06:42.330 --> 06:44.830
I'm sorry for the sudden visit.

06:45.330 --> 06:46.580
O-oh, not at all!

06:46.580 --> 06:48.630
Please make yourselves comfortable.

06:54.580 --> 06:55.630
Okay, here you go.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.540
Thanks, Mom!

06:57.960 --> 07:01.420
Sorry dinner's never that cute.

07:01.670 --> 07:05.290
Not at all. I love yakitori! It's great.

07:06.710 --> 07:08.000
Anyway, let me introduce you.

07:08.500 --> 07:10.500
This is my daughter, Ariel.

07:10.500 --> 07:11.960
I'm Ariel Baba.

07:12.170 --> 07:14.250
A-Ariel... Baba...

07:14.250 --> 07:15.920
It's very nice meeting you all!

07:16.420 --> 07:18.920
So you're her mother?

07:19.460 --> 07:22.380
That's right! She's my dear, adorable daughter!

07:22.580 --> 07:25.460
Oh, but please keep this a secret from the fans.

07:25.710 --> 07:27.460
I'm sure it will come as a shock.

07:27.460 --> 07:29.670
Aw, you always say that!

07:29.670 --> 07:33.830
But I'd feel awful for the fans who support you.

07:34.330 --> 07:36.170
Okay, can we ask a few questions?

07:36.920 --> 07:40.130
What is the day-to-day like for the two of you?

07:40.540 --> 07:46.710
Well, Ariel is so capable that
she makes things so easy for me.

07:46.710 --> 07:49.130
Hey, that's my line!

07:49.330 --> 07:49.920
Huh?

07:50.210 --> 07:54.920
My mom does so many part-time jobs
in between her idol work.

07:55.540 --> 07:58.630
My school fees, our living expenses...

07:59.290 --> 08:01.750
She earns all of it on her own!

08:02.420 --> 08:04.500
You're a single mother raising Ariel?

08:05.330 --> 08:05.960
That's right!

08:06.250 --> 08:08.170
I'm so sorry I ripped your poster!

08:08.170 --> 08:09.920
You're suddenly racked by guilt?!

08:10.210 --> 08:13.130
Besides, all the outfits she makes are so cute!

08:13.830 --> 08:17.790
Though whether I look good at all in them, well...

08:18.040 --> 08:19.580
But that looks amazing on you!

08:19.790 --> 08:20.380
Whoa?!

08:20.380 --> 08:22.290
Huh? Th-thanks.

08:22.500 --> 08:24.040
Give them all a good look.

08:24.040 --> 08:25.080
Uhhh?

08:25.080 --> 08:25.830
Oh, come on.

08:27.130 --> 08:28.420
So cute!

08:28.420 --> 08:31.170
It's much better-made than I'd expect. Annoyingly so.

08:31.170 --> 08:32.670
Why would you be annoyed?!

08:32.670 --> 08:33.960
Right, Ariel?

08:33.960 --> 08:34.580
Yeah!

08:38.420 --> 08:40.710
That was a big day. So much to take in.

08:41.540 --> 08:42.670
Yeah.

08:42.830 --> 08:45.630
But there's so much we can't talk about.

08:45.960 --> 08:48.250
I'm not sure what to put in the lyrics.

08:50.710 --> 08:53.330
Hey. What's your mother like, Yoru?

08:53.880 --> 08:55.380
That came out of nowhere.

08:55.920 --> 09:00.710
Well, those two today.
They had such a curious relationship.

09:01.460 --> 09:02.380
Ah...

09:03.250 --> 09:05.250
Things with my mom are normal.

09:05.580 --> 09:09.000
We get along reasonably well
and argue a reasonable amount.

09:09.420 --> 09:14.330
There's stuff I can't tell her but I ask
for important advice sometimes, too.

09:14.330 --> 09:16.920
So yeah, pretty normal I guess?

09:18.250 --> 09:19.330
I see.

09:21.830 --> 09:24.670
Uh... what about you, Kano?

09:25.880 --> 09:28.420
It's complicated, huh...?

09:28.420 --> 09:29.790
Um, never mind!

09:31.420 --> 09:33.540
Ugh, just forget I said anything.

09:38.000 --> 09:39.420
Uh, what?

09:39.420 --> 09:40.580
Nothing.

09:41.130 --> 09:42.500
Sure, okay.

09:42.670 --> 09:43.290
Huh?

09:44.710 --> 09:45.710
In my case...

09:46.380 --> 09:51.420
she was less like family and more like a business partner.

09:53.040 --> 09:55.580
She was your producer, wasn't she?

09:56.500 --> 09:57.040
Yeah.

09:57.500 --> 10:04.630
So once I made my debut, I wasn't her daughter
Kano Haya... Yamanouchi so much.

10:05.460 --> 10:08.750
I think she saw me more as the idol Nonoka Tachibana..

10:10.750 --> 10:12.710
More as Nonoka Tachibana...

10:13.830 --> 10:17.000
Well, now that I've quit it doesn't matter anymore!

10:17.540 --> 10:19.380
I have JELEE now.

10:20.210 --> 10:23.210
And probably, she doesn't really...

10:24.250 --> 10:25.880
need me anymore, anyway.

10:29.710 --> 10:30.670
I see.

10:32.500 --> 10:35.580
Hey, can I ask you one more thing?

10:36.920 --> 10:37.750
What?

10:38.380 --> 10:40.630
What was up with that kiss the other day?

10:42.750 --> 10:44.420
Why would you ask that now?!

10:44.420 --> 10:46.750
That was just... That's right, the spur of the moment!

10:46.920 --> 10:47.750
Okay?!

10:48.920 --> 10:51.540
You're finally back to your usual self.

10:53.000 --> 10:53.880
Yoru...

10:54.290 --> 10:56.790
You really are quite the character, aren't you?

11:01.630 --> 11:04.500
Cha Cha Cha Cha Cha Cha Chai Maxx

11:04.580 --> 11:06.290
Cha Cha Cha Cha!

11:12.580 --> 11:15.040
Miss Ariel, you sound splendid!

11:15.380 --> 11:17.420
Aw, thank you!

11:17.830 --> 11:20.330
Aren't you going to sing anything, Mei?

11:20.630 --> 11:22.830
Singing's a no-go for me.

11:23.420 --> 11:27.460
What about you Miss Ariel?
Aren't you going to wear those clothes anymore?

11:27.670 --> 11:31.170
Oh, when I wear those outside, well...

11:31.920 --> 11:32.790
"Well"?

11:33.080 --> 11:38.500
Hey Ariel, how do you feel about
your mother's idol activities?

11:39.000 --> 11:40.250
My mom's?

11:42.080 --> 11:46.830
Well, just a little while ago I was way more introverted.

11:47.580 --> 11:50.420
I didn't make any friends today, either.

11:51.210 --> 11:52.000
I'm ho-

11:53.170 --> 11:55.170
Welcome home, Ariel!

11:55.540 --> 11:56.580
Look at this!

11:56.920 --> 11:57.750
Ta-daa!

11:58.130 --> 12:00.130
Let's dance together in matching outfits!

12:00.500 --> 12:03.960
Plus for dinner tonight I made
your favorite - omelet on rice!

12:05.080 --> 12:07.290
What's wrong?! Was it something I did?!

12:07.580 --> 12:11.670
Is it because I keep waiting
to hatch as an idol and I never do?!

12:12.040 --> 12:14.170
Aw, it's nothing!

12:15.080 --> 12:17.710
After that, I felt so much better.

12:18.130 --> 12:19.750
It made me realize...

12:20.250 --> 12:24.170
it's okay for a person to talk like
that without thinking at all!

12:24.170 --> 12:27.330
Uh, is that what an elementary school kid's
supposed to learn from a parent?

12:27.580 --> 12:31.790
Since then, I gradually got better
about talking with my classmates.

12:31.920 --> 12:32.960
I know what you mean!

12:33.380 --> 12:37.380
The one thing that saves you from loneliness
is always the fave you stan!

12:41.630 --> 12:45.540
Um, are you someone's die-hard fan too, Mei?

12:46.750 --> 12:50.920
I am! I've always been a fan of my one and only.

12:51.330 --> 12:52.250
I knew it!

12:53.040 --> 12:59.750
Umm, when people don't understand
how great your fave is, what do you do?

13:00.330 --> 13:02.500
How great my fave is?

13:03.630 --> 13:06.420
See, I get laughed at a lot.

13:06.830 --> 13:07.540
Huh?

13:08.040 --> 13:12.080
Mom puts so much into dancing and
singing despite all the work she does,

13:12.710 --> 13:15.330
and she makes me so many cute outfits.

13:16.330 --> 13:20.670
But then people tease me, saying my mom isn't normal.

13:21.420 --> 13:24.540
Is my mom not normal?

13:25.250 --> 13:27.960
Is there something wrong with me...

13:28.460 --> 13:30.040
for liking her?

13:31.380 --> 13:32.670
Of course not!

13:33.920 --> 13:38.250
How could there be anything wrong
with you for liking someone?!

13:39.210 --> 13:41.130
R-really?

13:42.880 --> 13:50.080
A while ago, my favorite person ever got bashed
by the public like you wouldn't believe.

13:45.710 --> 13:50.210
<b>[Nonoka Tachibana] Impromptu Interview</b>

13:50.710 --> 13:52.750
It was so frustrating.

13:53.290 --> 13:58.210
They didn't know her. None of them had
ever talked with her, not even once.

13:59.250 --> 14:04.790
But she gave me words to cherish. She saved me.

14:06.130 --> 14:07.210
So I decided to believe.

14:08.540 --> 14:15.500
That at the very least, me liking her
definitely wasn't a mistake.

14:18.960 --> 14:21.210
So you have nothing to worry about.

14:22.080 --> 14:24.750
Stand tall, and be a fan to the very end.

14:25.290 --> 14:28.460
You're Ms. Miiko's TO, aren't you?

14:29.130 --> 14:31.500
T... tee-oh?

14:33.830 --> 14:35.500
I'm off!

14:35.790 --> 14:38.880
Once I get my New Year's shrine visit done,
I'll go straight to your gig!

14:38.880 --> 14:41.250
Sure. But Ariel?

14:41.630 --> 14:45.290
Those clothes... Aren't you going with your friends today?

14:45.960 --> 14:49.880
It's fine! You made this outfit for me, after all.

14:50.380 --> 14:54.920
Besides, I want to go to your gig in these clothes!

14:55.460 --> 14:56.920
Yeah?

14:57.460 --> 14:59.380
Okay, off you go then.

15:04.960 --> 15:06.790
Ari, what wish did you write down?

15:06.790 --> 15:09.880
I-it's a secret. Hey, wanna go draw fortunes?

15:09.880 --> 15:11.130
Yeah, let's!

15:11.290 --> 15:12.790
<b>Fortune</b>

15:14.170 --> 15:16.080
Huh. Isn't that Baba?

15:16.460 --> 15:17.290
Hmm.

15:19.250 --> 15:20.790
That's a great outfit!

15:20.920 --> 15:21.960
It's so cute!

15:21.960 --> 15:23.040
Thanks...

15:24.670 --> 15:26.290
Worried about Miss Ariel?

15:26.710 --> 15:29.960
Yeah. She's usually the first one here.

15:30.290 --> 15:32.250
She's a bit late, you know?

15:33.080 --> 15:37.250
Whoa, Baba! What's with that getup? Is it cosplay?!

15:38.380 --> 15:42.580
Hey, I know! Doesn't it have to do with that
Shibuya gig on PikPok Makoto told us about?!

15:42.580 --> 15:45.040
Baba's mom is totally hilarious!

15:50.290 --> 15:51.710
We're about to start.

15:52.670 --> 15:55.000
Ariel still isn't here, is she?

15:55.460 --> 15:58.670
No... She hasn't called me back, either.

15:59.250 --> 16:00.500
That's worrying.

16:02.830 --> 16:04.920
You actually left a comment?!

16:07.040 --> 16:08.750
I'm gonna post a reply, then!

16:08.750 --> 16:09.790
Oh, dang!

16:12.330 --> 16:13.330
What...?

16:13.960 --> 16:17.960
Mommy, help me with these frilly clothes.
I can't put them on all by myself!

16:17.960 --> 16:19.960
From your beloved Ariel.

16:20.250 --> 16:22.080
They posted Miss Ariel's name...

16:23.670 --> 16:26.630
It's probably some classmates being mean.

16:27.250 --> 16:29.500
This kind of thing happens in schools.

16:31.210 --> 16:32.500
This is my fault.

16:33.750 --> 16:36.830
All because... I'm not normal.

16:44.670 --> 16:45.830
I'm sorry, everyone.

16:46.130 --> 16:47.880
After all you've done for me, too.

16:47.880 --> 16:48.670
Huh?

16:52.170 --> 16:56.330
YAAAAAAAH!

16:58.920 --> 17:01.330
Uh, Miiko? Where are you going?!

17:01.330 --> 17:02.330
We're starting in-

17:02.330 --> 17:03.540
H... hold it!

17:03.540 --> 17:08.580
Really, Baba?! Who do you think gave a fading idol
like you a chance on stage, huh?!

17:11.830 --> 17:14.380
Hey, girls? You're with Baba, aren't you?

17:17.880 --> 17:20.080
Ladies and gentlemen!

17:22.040 --> 17:23.210
Where's my Miiko?!

17:23.210 --> 17:24.250
Uh, Miiko?!

17:24.250 --> 17:25.250
Who are they?

17:25.250 --> 17:26.130
Uhhh, what?

17:26.130 --> 17:27.130
What's happening?

17:27.330 --> 17:31.960
We're the most likely candidate to become
a future national singing sensation,

17:32.500 --> 17:33.960
JELEE!

17:35.580 --> 17:37.290
Or actually, their copy band.

17:39.000 --> 17:43.880
I'm an invincible girl, ah, ah

17:44.460 --> 17:46.380
Pappa la pa la pappa la

17:46.460 --> 17:48.170
Pappa la pa la pappa la

17:48.380 --> 17:51.170
Pappa la pa la pappa la, yeah

17:51.420 --> 17:53.210
I'm an invincible unrivaled girl

17:53.210 --> 17:55.170
Dreams and hopes set my heart aglow

17:55.170 --> 17:58.540
See, look how bright the world is shining

17:58.710 --> 18:02.420
That's the power inside the magic you provide

18:02.420 --> 18:04.420
<b>Please let my mom
continue being an idol
Ariel</b>

18:02.540 --> 18:05.920
It’s like a precious jewel

18:06.080 --> 18:07.920
Baba, I mean look at this.

18:06.170 --> 18:08.000
Even higher than the clouds I whirl

18:08.000 --> 18:09.880
Swimming free in the sky of azure

18:08.080 --> 18:09.710
It's the funniest thing ever.

18:09.710 --> 18:11.040
That's too funny!

18:10.000 --> 18:13.330
So much that the gods might want a word with me

18:11.250 --> 18:12.170
Yeah, right?!

18:12.170 --> 18:13.420
Seriously, look at that!

18:13.580 --> 18:17.080
That's the power inside the wonder you provide

18:17.420 --> 18:20.380
It made me feel I could go anywhere

18:20.380 --> 18:21.580
Yeah, come on!

18:20.580 --> 18:24.630
Even if people scoff and call it bad art

18:21.580 --> 18:22.830
Jeez, c'mon guys!

18:24.630 --> 18:28.790
If I just keep on drawing the real me

18:24.670 --> 18:25.830
S-sorry!

18:26.000 --> 18:26.670
See?

18:26.670 --> 18:29.040
What do you even know about my mom?!

18:28.790 --> 18:34.920
I'm sure that it will become a light to guide somebody's way

18:29.790 --> 18:34.540
You don't know anything about
how cool or how cute she is!

18:34.540 --> 18:36.750
Well, her social profile is full of lies!

18:35.170 --> 18:39.540
Invincible girl, I have nothing to fear

18:36.750 --> 18:37.710
Shut up!

18:38.080 --> 18:40.830
Maybe, but I still like my mom!

18:39.540 --> 18:42.790
Because I found the piece that I was missing

18:41.210 --> 18:45.540
My mom's the cutest in the galaxy,
she's great at growing pea shoots,

18:42.790 --> 18:49.880
I won't give in to anyone anymore,
not even to the timid me that's made up of lies

18:45.880 --> 18:48.080
and even her being a liar is actually cute!

18:49.540 --> 18:52.920
Besides, I'm my mom's TO...

18:50.000 --> 18:54.290
Escape the ocean depths to the starry sky

18:53.290 --> 18:54.790
Her top otaku!

18:54.290 --> 19:00.880
Even if people laugh that it's
an impossible dream, I'll get there with you

19:01.130 --> 19:04.330
Come on, let's go to the top of the world

19:04.330 --> 19:05.830
And there let's dance

19:05.830 --> 19:07.880
Pappa la pa la pappa la

19:23.250 --> 19:23.830
Right.

19:24.380 --> 19:28.040
Hey, everyone! Thanks for watching my music video!

19:28.500 --> 19:30.170
Uh?! Is that Baba's mom?!

19:30.330 --> 19:32.040
Shoot, it's actually her.

19:32.040 --> 19:37.000
So anyway, boys. Do you have any interest
in a live performance instead of a video?

19:37.380 --> 19:40.040
Why don't you come along to my gig?

19:40.880 --> 19:42.130
Uh, no...

19:43.000 --> 19:44.210
Sorry about that!

19:45.250 --> 19:47.460
M-Mom. What about your gig?!

19:47.830 --> 19:50.420
Ha ha. I ditched it, actually.

19:50.500 --> 19:52.000
Y-you can't do that!

19:52.330 --> 19:55.580
You're an idol, Mom. You've gotta go back!

19:56.000 --> 19:56.880
Come on!

19:57.710 --> 20:01.250
Yeah, you're right. I am an idol,

20:01.830 --> 20:02.790
aren't I?

20:08.750 --> 20:09.460
Huh?!

20:14.290 --> 20:16.880
Thanks for waiting!

20:19.210 --> 20:22.750
Girls, thanks for opening the stage for me!

20:23.380 --> 20:25.330
Okay, onto my first song!

20:25.630 --> 20:31.000
But before that, there's something I have to tell you all.

20:32.040 --> 20:34.630
I've been lying to everyone.

20:34.630 --> 20:36.040
Wait, what?

20:37.080 --> 20:41.380
I'm not actually forever seventeen, but thirty-one...

20:41.380 --> 20:42.420
...and divorced...

20:42.420 --> 20:43.040
Divorced?!

20:43.170 --> 20:44.040
...and a mom.

20:44.040 --> 20:44.830
A mom?!

20:44.040 --> 20:44.830
What?!

20:44.960 --> 20:49.080
So starting today, I'm not Miiko anymore.

20:50.000 --> 20:53.580
I'm a super idol for Ariel's sake,

20:54.500 --> 20:56.540
Shizue Baba!

21:06.500 --> 21:07.710
Thanks, everyone!

21:07.710 --> 21:09.130
I feel like a new person!

21:09.670 --> 21:12.380
Are you sure you wanted to tell them everything?

21:12.380 --> 21:14.210
It's fine! I mean...

21:14.210 --> 21:15.630
Mom!

21:16.080 --> 21:17.790
You were amazing out there!

21:18.750 --> 21:20.250
"Mom," she says.

21:20.670 --> 21:22.500
Can I really learn to live with this?!

21:23.750 --> 21:26.920
A thirty-one-year-old, divorced idol with a daughter!

21:27.250 --> 21:29.880
That's me, but I'm cute as ever, right?

21:32.170 --> 21:35.880
Byoushin wa tomaranai ochikonderu hima wa nai

21:35.880 --> 21:44.420
Mainichi ga maninonrei da yaritaikoto darake no list

21:44.630 --> 21:51.380
Hanasu to nagaku natte shimau kara temijika ni uta de tsutaeru yo

21:51.580 --> 21:59.290
Kimi o mitsuketa ano yoru kara rhythm wa kasoku shihajimeta

22:01.670 --> 22:09.500
Ichinichi tatta no 24 jikan ja zenzen tarinainda

22:09.830 --> 22:16.500
Mada yoru ni oitsukenai noni mou asa ga kuru

22:16.630 --> 22:28.880
Ato ichijikan de iikara ano tsuki o nagamete itai kimi to onaji tsuki o

22:29.080 --> 22:35.750
Arifureta ima ni koi shitara sukoshi dake saido agatta mirai

22:35.750 --> 22:41.290
Sonna fuu ni ashita o matte ita

22:47.040 --> 22:52.710
<b>Thirty-One Lollipop</b>

22:47.040 --> 22:52.710
<b>820K views · 3 days ago #ShizueBaba</b>

22:47.040 --> 22:52.710
<b>Miiko Channel</b>

22:47.960 --> 22:49.830
820k views?!

22:50.790 --> 22:52.290
Man, that went viral.

22:53.080 --> 22:54.920
It's only been up for a few days.

22:54.920 --> 22:57.420
<b>I feel so much better realizing I don't have
to give up on "cute" even after turning 30!</b>

22:55.250 --> 22:57.000
The response was incredible!

22:57.710 --> 23:01.170
But really, Kiui. Nothing is sacred to you, huh?

23:01.380 --> 23:03.330
It's exactly what Ms. Shizue asked for.

23:05.330 --> 23:06.290
Let's see...

23:06.210 --> 23:10.420
<b>[MV] Shibuya Aquarium / JELEE</b>

23:06.210 --> 23:10.420
<b>960K views · 3 weeks ago  #JELEE</b>

23:06.290 --> 23:08.580
Shibuya Aquarium at the moment has...

23:08.580 --> 23:10.420
960k views!

23:10.420 --> 23:14.500
Please! Let us be the first to get 1m views!

23:14.880 --> 23:18.670
Though at this rate, I think
Baba Lollipop might get there first.

23:19.000 --> 23:23.540
Stop! Don't act like the weird title people
use in the comments is official!

23:23.540 --> 23:28.710
But anyway, now we're another step closer
to getting 100k followers.

23:29.250 --> 23:33.500
We've got to make sure Shizue "formerly Miiko"
Baba doesn't overtake us.

23:33.580 --> 23:34.250
See?

23:34.250 --> 23:38.500
<b>For lunch today I'm having yakitori rice bowls with Ariel!
Extra large, too!</b>

23:34.920 --> 23:39.040
The idol waiting to hatch finally emerged,
the cutest in the galaxy!
